# A1 joins three different claims that all use "work". Critics of this passage sometimes find a slide in "work": a craftsman's job, an organ's function, and Man's own work.
# But the sentence treats all three as one notion, the characteristic activity of the thing. Within each claim the word keeps that one sense in every statement that uses it, so I name no bridge.
